823 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Experience\nStaff Engineer\054 AEtna\nFeb 2018 \055 Present\nI work on both Aetna member features \046 our design system component library\056\nExperienced technical leader on feature teams\nAI maven for current feature team\073 using Figmas\031 Code Connect to map our design properties to our React component library properties to expand skills for Claude Code to take design urls to build new components\nBuild UI components for the Aetna component library using React\057TS\056 \nBuild core member features such as provider search\054 appointment scheduling\054 claims\054 payments\054 and spending\n\050Some of my personal highlights\072 \nfirst feature team engineer to migrate a core feature to be an MFE\nas lead\054 I created feature documentation for all of my teams\031 features to significantly improve onboarding and centralize technical decisions\npresent lightning talks during the biweekly web engineering meeting\nwork with architects and server engineers to  \nstreamlined how web teams keep track of progress for web initiatives\nbuilt some of the most used components in our component library such as Accordion\054 Paginate\054 Stepper\054 SidebarLayout\054 ProgressBar\054 etc\n\nSenior Front\055end Developer\054 Kalkomey\nOct 2015 \055 Aug 2017\nI worked on both the custom content management system and licensing system\056\nLed the UI development for a customizable storefront \050react\057rails\051\nBuilt the UI for the internal CMS\057LMS\056 \050angular2\053\057rails\051\nLed the UI for the product suite\054 \034Agency Management Solution\035 which allows for state agencies to manage subscriptions\054 licensing\054 tags\054 etc\056\nCreated frontend code standards and living styleguides for all new projects for more rapid development and consistency across products which\054 for example\054 led to new a product UI to be demo\055able to clients in less than 5 weeks\056\n\nSoftware Engineer II\054 Join\031em\nApr 2014 \055 Aug 2015\nBuilt the UI for a social e\055commerce web app \050angular1\056x\057Django\051 working closely with back\055end engineers to launch the MVP\056 Created the living styleguide and a custom reusable pattern library\056\n\nFront\055end Developer\054 Online Performance Marketing \053 Apollo Interactive\nMarch 2013 \055 Apr 2014\nBuilt custom WordPress themes\057plugins\054 created reusable \053 responsive email templates\054 fixed bugs\054 etc\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 830 0 R
     /Pg 822 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
